AI Assistant assets (Lorebook fork)
===================================

This directory contains editorial agent and skill markdown adapted from the
Brainstormer project, a fork of Creative Writing Skills, for use with the
optional Claude Code integration in Lorebook.

Source project: Creative Writing Skills by Jimmy Yao (@haowjy)
  https://github.com/haowjy/creative-writing-skills
Immediate source: brainstormer by fyne4247, a fork of the project above
  https://github.com/fyne4247/brainstormer
License: Apache License 2.0
License text: ../../../setup/LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt
Source checked: 14 October 2026. The upstream repository did not contain a
separate NOTICE file at that time.

Changes made for Lorebook: the agent and skill Markdown was adapted for
novelWriter projects and its project-setup/sidebar workflow, and is distributed
as versioned package data so installed and source-run copies use the same files.
Lorebook project code and writing prompts are separate works; this notice does
not change the upstream licence.

Contents:
  claude/agents/  — agent system prompts (critic, muse, …)
  claude/skills/  — skill packages loaded by those agents

These files are copied into a novelWriter project tree under .claude/ when the
user runs "Set up AI for Project". They do not include the Claude Code binary
or any API credentials. The fork was prepared for public distribution on
14 October 2026.
